Conflicts: sentinella,
Description: interactive per-application firewall and process watchdog
 Varco holds every new network connection, outgoing or incoming, until
 a rule or the user allows or blocks it. For each connection it shows which
 program asks (executable, command line, user, systemd unit), the remote
 address with the name the system really resolved, and optionally who owns
 the address (whois).
 .
 Features:
  * permanent rules per program, host, port and protocol;
  * kill switch that isolates the computer, manual or automatic;
  * pause, fail-closed behaviour, state kept across restarts;
  * watchdog that reports new programs and programs with suspicious traits;
  * D-Bus system service authorized through polkit, hardened systemd unit.
 .
 This package contains the service and the command line tool. The service is
 not enabled at installation.

Package: varco-gtk
Architecture: all
