         python3-gi,
         varco (= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
Conflicts: sentinella-gtk,
Description: interactive per-application firewall - graphical interface
 Varco holds every new network connection until a rule or the user
 allows or blocks it.
 .
 This package contains the GTK 4 / libadwaita interface: desktop
 notifications with Allow/Block buttons, activity, programs started,
 active connections, rules, privacy and preferences.

Package: varco-privacy
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Depends: iproute2,
         mount,
         varco (= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: network-manager,
Conflicts: sentinella-anonimo,
Description: reduce the identifiers a computer exposes
 Optional module of Varco. It can randomize the MAC address (also for
 Wi-Fi scans) and enable IPv6 temporary addresses, set a generic computer
 name, generate a new machine-id and hide hardware serial numbers
 (DMI/SMBIOS, UUID, disk serials) from the programs of the system.
 .
 Every change is backed up and reverted with "varco-privacy restore",
 which runs automatically when the package is removed. The real serial
 numbers stored in the firmware are not changed.
